''(a) Race status:'' ''Closed for the prior probe shape'' in commit `535b62b30`. The cure now (i) blocks founding while owed raises exist (`packages/lararium-mesh/src/content-key-holder.ts:497-499`), (ii) re-reads owed raises via callback (`.../content-key-holder.ts:506-507`, fed by `.../content-key-seat.ts:213-216`), and (iii) rechecks at commit point after manifest signing and before first value write (`.../content-key-holder.ts:518-524`). Both founding and already-founded bag races are explicitly covered (`packages/lararium-keyhive/tests/content-key-seat.test.ts:303-313`). ''UNTRACED:'' exhaustive “roll lands at every await inside seal” instrumentation is not present; the harness pause is at first signature (`.../content-key-seat.test.ts:281-287`), not a per-await matrix.

''(b) Other #140 HIGHs:'' none found. Foreign-face sealing/opening/reading is refused (`packages/lararium-keyhive/src/operator-daemon-behavior.ts:789-790`, `packages/lararium-node/tests/sealed-store-vessel.test.ts:225-241`). Booking lifetime is bounded to call/socket and released in `finally` (`packages/lararium-node/src/uds-channel.ts:1075-1087`), with released/unknown/wrong-verb refusals and duplicate-id first-booking behavior enforced (`packages/lararium-node/src/session-sign-door.ts:41-46,54-57`; `.../tests/session-sign-door.test.ts:46-74`). Non-session borrowing of a live booking is blocked by local/session gating plus request-id arbitration (`packages/lararium-keyhive/src/operator-daemon-behavior.ts:783-787`; `packages/lararium-node/src/uds-channel.ts:1359-1389`), and session calls are face-scoped (`.../uds-channel.ts:1076,1081`; `packages/lararium-mesh/src/face-scoped-id.ts:8-13`).

''(c) #138 HIGHs:'' none found in commit `1b7be63b4`/`87e638c49`. Filename selection is fixed-name, not host-fact-derived (`packages/lararium-node/src/node-vessel-identity.ts:138,180-181,384-386`; `packages/lararium-node/src/vault-carriers.ts:308,314,317`), while git config use is display-name only (`.../node-vessel-identity.ts:112-121`). Boot/load on old/unrecognized trees refuses “no key file” and mints nothing (`.../node-vessel-identity.ts:485-489`; `packages/lararium-node/tests/custody-names-read-no-login.test.ts:95-103`).

''(d) Cross-lane meet:'' no unsafe intersection found. The fifth door is an in-memory session-sign bridge (`packages/lararium-node/src/worker-handle.ts:123-154,229-235`) wired from `SessionSignBook` (`packages/lararium-node/src/open-node-vessel.ts` at `535b62b30:1699-1701`); #138 changes custody filename resolution (`node-vessel-identity.ts`, `vault-carriers.ts`) and does not provide a path read by `session:sign`.

| Severity | Finding | File:line |h
| LOW | ''UNTRACED evidence gap:'' no explicit per-await race harness for `sealBlob`; coverage pauses first signature, not every await site | `packages/lararium-keyhive/tests/content-key-seat.test.ts:281-287` |

''SHIP''

